WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,200
If there are any compliance results in the future, the commercial value will be immeasurable.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:11,800
So what, I have the world in hand and I will swim. I will never do any research or engage in high technology. I just want to explore and inspect.

3
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:18,600
Depending on your ability, it may not be difficult to get rich, but these samples may promote anti-aging and cell repair research, and you don't want to participate at all.

4
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:22,800
The research results must undergo experimental clinical trials and approval, and will not be launched in the short term.

5
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:28,700
Join the project now to be eligible to continue to understand the progress. If you want to regret it now, it’s still too late.

6
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:32,300
I haven't even completed the basic experiments yet, and you want to use future results to manipulate me.

7
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:35,670
I admit that I can't promise any results now

8
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:39,470
Fanjia is willing to invest funds and teams, and hopes you will continue to be stable.

9
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,670
No, this woman started to take control after getting a thousand years of life, and in turn wanted to ride on the boss's head.

10
00:00:44,670 --> 00:00:45,670
under such circumstances
